{"description": "<h2>Your mission</h2>\n<div style=\"border:0px solid;margin:0px 0px 24px;color:rgb(31,31,31);font-size:14px;line-height:20px;width:700px;font-family:Inter, '-apple-system', BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', 'Open Sans', 'system-ui', '-apple-system', 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Ubuntu, Cantarell, 'Noto Sans', sans-serif, 'Apple Color Emoji', 'Segoe UI Emoji';font-style:normal;font-weight:400;text-transform:none;background-color:rgb(255,255,255);\"><div style=\"border:0px solid;margin:0px;font-family:'Segoe UI';font-size:14px;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;line-height:20px;\"><h3 style=\"border:0px solid;margin:0px;line-height:28px;font-weight:600;font-size:24px;font-family:'FT Regola Neue', Inter, '-apple-system', BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', 'Open Sans', 'system-ui', '-apple-system', 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Ubuntu, Cantarell, 'Noto Sans', sans-serif, 'Apple Color Emoji', 'Segoe UI Emoji', sans-serif;\"><strong style=\"border:0px solid;margin:0px;font-weight:600;\"><span style=\"border:0px solid;margin:0px;font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14px;\">Key Responsibilities</span></strong></h3><ul style=\"border:0px solid;\"><li style=\"border:0px solid;margin:0px;font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14px;\">Gather, document, and analyze business requirements</li><li style=\"border:0px solid;margin:0px;font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14px;\">Work with stakeholders to understand needs and translate them into functional specifications</li><li style=\"border:0px solid;margin:0px;font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14px;\">Create clear documentation (user stories, process flows, business requirements documents)</li><li style=\"border:0px solid;margin:0px;font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14px;\">Support solution design and ensure alignment with business goals</li><li style=\"border:0px solid;margin:0px;font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14px;\">Collaborate with development and QA teams during implementation</li><li style=\"border:0px solid;margin:0px;font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14px;\">Participate in testing and validation of solutions</li><li style=\"border:0px solid;margin:0px;font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14px;\">Identify process improvements and recommend optimization opportunities</li><li style=\"border:0px solid;margin:0px;font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14px;\">Support project delivery and ensure timelines are met</li><li style=\"border:0px solid;margin:0px;font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14px;\"><br></li><li style=\"border:0px solid;margin:0px;\">Analyse and map current (AS-IS) and future (TO-BE) business processes using standard modelling techniques (e.g. BPMN, flowcharts)</li><li style=\"border:0px solid;margin:0px;\">Facilitate workshops and stakeholder sessions to capture detailed process flows, dependencies, and pain points</li><li style=\"border:0px solid;margin:0px;\">Identify inefficiencies, bottlenecks, and optimisation opportunities across end-to-end processes</li><li style=\"border:0px solid;margin:0px;\">Ensure process documentation is clear, standardised, and aligned with business and IT objectives</li><li style=\"border:0px solid;margin:0px;\">Support solution design by translating process maps into functional requirements and improvement initiatives</li><li style=\"border:0px solid;margin:0px;\">Collaborate with cross-functional teams to validate processes and ensure successful implementation of changes</li></ul></div></div><div style=\"border:0px solid;margin:0px 0px 24px;color:rgb(31,31,31);font-size:14px;line-height:20px;width:700px;font-family:Inter, '-apple-system', BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', 'Open Sans', 'system-ui', '-apple-system', 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Ubuntu, Cantarell, 'Noto Sans', sans-serif, 'Apple Color Emoji', 'Segoe UI Emoji';font-style:normal;font-weight:400;text-transform:none;background-color:rgb(255,255,255);\"><h6 style=\"border:0px solid;margin:0px 0px 12px;line-height:19.6px;font-weight:700;font-size:14px;font-family:'FT Regola Neue', Inter, '-apple-system', BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', 'Open Sans', 'system-ui', '-apple-system', 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Ubuntu, Cantarell, 'Noto Sans', sans-serif, 'Apple Color Emoji', 'Segoe UI Emoji', sans-serif;text-transform:none;color:rgb(31,31,31);\"><br></h6></div>\n<h2>Your profile</h2>\n<div style=\"border:0px solid;margin:0px 0px 24px;color:rgb(31,31,31);font-size:14px;line-height:20px;width:700px;font-family:Inter, '-apple-system', BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', 'Open Sans', 'system-ui', '-apple-system', 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Ubuntu, Cantarell, 'Noto Sans', sans-serif, 'Apple Color Emoji', 'Segoe UI Emoji';font-style:normal;font-weight:400;text-transform:none;background-color:rgb(255,255,255);\"><h3 style=\"border:0px solid;margin:0px;line-height:28px;font-weight:600;font-size:24px;font-family:'FT Regola Neue', Inter, '-apple-system', BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', 'Open Sans', 'system-ui', '-apple-system', 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Ubuntu, Cantarell, 'Noto Sans', sans-serif, 'Apple Color Emoji', 'Segoe UI Emoji', sans-serif;\"><strong style=\"border:0px solid;margin:0px;font-weight:600;\"><span style=\"border:0px solid;margin:0px;font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14px;\">Required Skills & Experience</span></strong></h3><ul style=\"border:0px solid;\"><li style=\"border:0px solid;margin:0px;font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14px;\">Experience as a Business Analyst</li><li style=\"border:0px solid;margin:0px;font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14px;\">Ability to communicate effectively with both technical and non-technical stakeholders</li><li style=\"border:0px solid;margin:0px;font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14px;\">Experience with requirement gathering techniques (e.g., workshops, interviews)</li><li style=\"border:0px solid;margin:0px;font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14px;\">Familiarity with Agile or Waterfall methodologies</li><li style=\"border:0px solid;margin:0px;font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14px;\">Good documentation skills (e.g., user stories, BRDs)</li><li style=\"border:0px solid;margin:0px;font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14px;\">Proficiency in tools such as Excel, Jira, Confluence, or similar</li></ul><div style=\"font-family:'Segoe UI';font-size:14px;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;line-height:20px;\"><ul><li>Strong process modelling and analysis skills (BPMN, process flows, swimlane diagrams)</li><li>Ability to break down complex workflows into structured, understandable components</li><li>Excellent facilitation skills for workshops and stakeholder interviews</li><li>Analytical mindset with focus on continuous improvement and optimisation</li><li>Strong documentation and visualisation skills (Visio, Lucidchart, or similar)</li><li>Good understanding of business operations and how systems support processes</li><li>Ability to bridge business needs with technical implementation</li></ul></div><div style=\"border:0px solid;margin:0px;font-family:'Segoe UI';font-size:14px;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;line-height:20px;\"><h3 style=\"border:0px solid;margin:0px;line-height:28px;font-weight:600;font-size:24px;font-family:'FT Regola Neue', Inter, '-apple-system', BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', 'Open Sans', 'system-ui', '-apple-system', 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Ubuntu, Cantarell, 'Noto Sans', sans-serif, 'Apple Color Emoji', 'Segoe UI Emoji', sans-serif;\"><span style=\"border:0px solid;margin:0px;font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14px;\"><strong style=\"border:0px solid;margin:0px;font-weight:600;\">Nice to Have</strong></span></h3></div><span style=\"border:0px solid;margin:0px;font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14px;\"><strong style=\"border:0px solid;margin:0px;font-weight:600;\">- </strong></span>Experience in the aircraft or leasing industry<br>- Experience in the finance sector<br>- Good to have worked with Adonis for BPMN or Azure DevOps for planning</div>\n<h2>What we offer</h2>\n<ul style=\"border:0px;margin:16px 0px 16px 16px;padding:0px;font-size:14px;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;text-transform:none;background:0px 0px;color:rgb(68,68,68);font-family:Montserrat, sans-serif;\"><li style=\"border:0px;margin:0px 0px 8px;padding:0px 0px 0px 16px;background:0px 0px;line-height:21px;font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"border:0px;margin:0px;padding:0px;background:0px 0px;line-height:1.7rem;\"><span style=\"border:0px;margin:0px;padding:0px;background:0px 0px;line-height:1.7rem;\"><span style=\"border:0px;margin:0px;padding:0px;background:0px 0px;line-height:1.7rem;\"><span style=\"border:0px;margin:0px;padding:0px;background:0px 0px;line-height:1.7rem;\"><b style=\"border:0px;margin:0px;font-weight:bolder;padding:0px;background:0px 0px;\">Medical insurance</b><b style=\"border:0px;margin:0px;font-weight:bolder;padding:0px;background:0px 0px;\"><span style=\"border:0px;margin:0px;padding:0px;background:0px 0px;line-height:1.7rem;\"> </span></b></span></span>– Because your health and that of your family is our top priority. You’re covered!</span></span></li><li style=\"border:0px;margin:0px 0px 8px;padding:0px 0px 0px 16px;background:0px 0px;line-height:21px;font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"border:0px;margin:0px;padding:0px;background:0px 0px;line-height:1.7rem;\"><span style=\"border:0px;margin:0px;padding:0px;background:0px 0px;line-height:1.7rem;\"><span style=\"border:0px;margin:0px;padding:0px;background:0px 0px;line-height:1.7rem;\"><b style=\"border:0px;margin:0px;font-weight:bolder;padding:0px;background:0px 0px;\">Holiday flat in Valencia<span style=\"border:0px;margin:0px;padding:0px;background:0px 0px;line-height:1.7rem;\"> </span></b></span>– Dreaming of sunny days in Spain? Our company flat is ready for your next getaway.</span></span></li><li style=\"border:0px;margin:0px 0px 8px;padding:0px 0px 0px 16px;background:0px 0px;line-height:21px;font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"border:0px;margin:0px;padding:0px;background:0px 0px;line-height:1.7rem;\"><span style=\"border:0px;margin:0px;padding:0px;background:0px 0px;line-height:1.7rem;\"><span style=\"border:0px;margin:0px;padding:0px;background:0px 0px;line-height:1.7rem;\"><b style=\"border:0px;margin:0px;font-weight:bolder;padding:0px;background:0px 0px;\">Gifts for special occasions</b><span style=\"border:0px;margin:0px;padding:0px;background:0px 0px;line-height:1.7rem;\"> </span></span>– We love celebrating you! Expect thoughtful surprises on Easter, Women’s Day, Father’s Day, and more.</span></span></li><li style=\"border:0px;margin:0px 0px 8px;padding:0px 0px 0px 16px;background:0px 0px;line-height:21px;font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"border:0px;margin:0px;padding:0px;background:0px 0px;line-height:1.7rem;\"><span style=\"border:0px;margin:0px;padding:0px;background:0px 0px;line-height:1.7rem;\"><span style=\"border:0px;margin:0px;padding:0px;background:0px 0px;line-height:1.7rem;\"><b style=\"border:0px;margin:0px;font-weight:bolder;padding:0px;background:0px 0px;\">Anniversary gifts</b><span style=\"border:0px;margin:0px;padding:0px;background:0px 0px;line-height:1.7rem;\"> </span></span>– Each work anniversary is a milestone worth celebrating, and we’ll continue to mark every year you spend with us with a special gift.</span></span></li><li style=\"border:0px;margin:0px 0px 8px;padding:0px 0px 0px 16px;background:0px 0px;line-height:21px;font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"border:0px;margin:0px;padding: